   "source": [
    "# Access Coastal blue carbon\n",
    "\n",
    "> This is a subset of the full dataset, covering the Mediterranean Sea.\n",
    "\n",
    "The European Space Agency (ESA) commissioned a consortium of experts to develop novel and innovative tools, indicators and methods based on Earth Observation (EO), for the benefit of interested end-users for the monitoring, restoration, and conservation of seagrass meadows, salt marshes and mangroves.\n",
    "\n",
    "This datasets consists of three file types for the years 2016, 2020, 2024.\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **HAB-MAP-POLY** — predicted *Posidonia* meadow polygons.\n",
    "2. **HAB-MAP-GRID** — habitat predictions on hexagons with **20 m sides**, including bathymetry and confidence.\n",
    "3. **CARB-MAP** — associated predicted carbon stock density on the hexagonal mesh.\n",

    "* EO4SOCIETY Website: https://eo4society.esa.int/projects/coastal-blue-carbon/\n",

   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "fd0157a1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Accessing the data\n",
    "\n",
    "The maps cover **2.2–3.6° E, 39.05–40.0° N**, including Mallorca, Cabrera and the surrounding coastal waters."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "28e4454b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "import geopandas as gpd\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "from matplotlib.colors import BoundaryNorm, ListedColormap\n",
    "from matplotlib.patches import Patch, Rectangle\n",
    "import cartopy.crs as ccrs\n",
    "import cartopy.feature as cfeature\n",
    "from pyproj import Transformer\n",
    "from IPython.display import display\n",
    "\n",
    "BASE_URL = \"https://s3.waw4-1.cloudferro.com/EarthCODE/OSCAssets/cbc/med-extract\"\n",
    "\n",
    "URLS = {\n",
    "    \"polygons\": f\"{BASE_URL}/ESA-CBC_MED_PV0_HAB-MAP-POLY_HS1-lvl1_MULTI_20240301_20241031_S2X_3035.gpkg\",\n",
    "    \"grid\": f\"{BASE_URL}/ESA-CBC_MED_PV0_HAB-MAP-GRID_HS1-lvl1_MULTI_20240301_20241031_S2X_3035.gpkg\",\n",
    "    \"carbon\": f\"{BASE_URL}/ESA-CBC_MED_PV0_CARB-MAP-GRID_CS1-lvl2_SINGL_20241231_X_3035.gpkg\",\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "BOUNDS = (2.2, 39.05, 3.6, 40.0)\n",
    "bbox = Transformer.from_crs(4326, 3035, always_xy=True).transform_bounds(*BOUNDS)\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
  {
