    "## CARB-MAP\n",
    "\n",
    "**Carbon Stock Map (hexagonal mesh) - Mediterranean Pilot Region Version 0 (2024-12-31)**\n",
    "\n",
    "This product is a predictive map of carbon stocks present in our ecosystems of interest (salt marsh, seagrass, mangrove). Carbon values ​​estimated with field measurements and bibliographic knowledge are applied to the predicted polygons proposed in our 'Habitat map hexagonal mesh' products.\n",
    "\n",
    "**`mean_carbon_stocks` is carbon stock density in Mg/ha**, with display intervals 0–50, 50–100, 100–150, 150–200, 200–250, 250–300, 300–350 and 350–500. Densities cannot be summed directly into total carbon mass. The unit and time basis of `mean_carbon_accum` are unspecified in the metadata.\n",
    "\n",
    "| Metadata | Value |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| Metadata identifier | 8a740c6d-bb4b-46b9-936e-10d602cf111d |\n",
    "| Metadata date | 2026-02-06 |\n",
    "| Publication date | 2026-02-06 |\n",
    "| Metadata language / encoding | French (`fre`) / UTF-8 (`utf8`) |\n",
    "| Coordinate reference system | EPSG:3035 — ETRS89-extended / LAEA Europe |\n",
    "| Observation period | 2024-12-31 to 2024-12-31 |\n",
    "| Spatial resolution recorded in XML | 0 m (placeholder; the abstract describes a hexagonal mesh) |\n",
    "| Geographic bounds (longitude) | -7.227540379009844 to 10.315043579880012° |\n",
    "| Geographic bounds (latitude) | 37.30242537840972 to 42.34881482953961° |\n",
    "| Distribution format | Geopackage, version 1.0 |\n",
    "| Topic category | environment |\n",
    "| Metadata XML schema | http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmd http://schemas.opengis.net/iso/19139/20070417/gmd/gmd.xsd |\n",
    "\n",
    "**Contacts**\n",
    "\n",
    "- Metadata contact: Cecile Curti, i-Sea — cecile.curti@i-sea.fr.\n",
    "- Resource provider: Benoit Beguet, i-Sea — benoit.beguet@i-sea.fr.\n",
    "- Resource provider: Oscar Serrano, CEAB — oserrano@ceab.csic.es.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Keywords**\n",
    "\n",
    "- Place: Mediterranean, Pilot Region Version 0.\n",
    "- Theme: Habitats and biotopes, Bio-geographical regions.\n",
    "  Thesaurus: GEMET - INSPIRE themes, version 1.0; published 2008-06-01. Identifier: `geonetwork.thesaurus.external.theme.httpinspireeceuropaeutheme-theme`. Registry address recorded in XML: `http://localhost:8080/geonetwork/srv/api/registries/vocabularies/external.theme.httpinspireeceuropaeutheme-theme`.\n",
    "- Theme: Coastal Blue Carbon, ESA, European Space Agency, i-Sea, CEAB, Habitat mapping, Satellite, EO, Earth Observation, Copernicus, Sentinel-2, Monitoring, Hexagonal mesh, Mediterranean Coast, Subtidal Seagrass, Posidonia, Carbon map.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Lineage and processing**\n",
    "\n",
    "The carbon maps are derived from the habitat maps produced for the project.Carbon values were estimated using BRT modeling of environmental variables and applied to predicted habitat contours in hexagonal grid format. Carbon maps for three different years were produced (2016, 2020, and 2024)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Funding, rights and attribution**\n",
    "\n",
    "This project has received funding from the European Space Agency's Earth Observation Science for Society (EO4Society) programmatic element of the ESA FutureEO-1 Segment-2 Programme, Coastal Blue Carbon project under Contract No. 4000143758/23/I-NS (c) 2024-2026, CBC Product, i-Sea, All rights reserved products derived from external data 2024"
   ]
  },
  {
